+   3.   The identifier is read once, from left to right.  Every "%" MUST
+        begin an escape of two hexadecimal digits.  A "%" that does not,
+        or an escape of an unreserved character (ALPHA, DIGIT, "-", ".",
+        "_" or "~", [RFC3986] Section 2.3), makes the identifier not
